h', and 'navigate'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["316"],"jsx-a11y/no-redundant-roles","The element button has an implicit role of button. Defining this explicitly is redundant and should be avoided.","no-useless-concat","Unexpected string concatenation of literals.","unexpectedConcat","'keys' is assigned a value but never used.","'timeShow' is assigned a value but never used.",{"desc":"317","fix":"318"},{"desc":"319","fix":"320"},{"desc":"321","fix":"322"},{"desc":"323","fix":"324"},{"desc":"325","fix":"326"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, projects]",{"range":"327","text":"328"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",{"range":"329","text":"330"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, comfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",{"range":"331","text":"332"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",{"range":"333","text":"334"},"Update the dependencies array to be: [authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, location, navigate]",{"range":"335","text":"336"},[6235,6246],"[authToken, projects]",[2100,2111],"[authToken, settingStore.value.theme]",[20263,20284],"[authToken, comfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",[16454,16475],"[authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, id.word, location, navigate]",[16050,16071],"[authToken, callConfirmSetting, firstOpenSearch, location, navigate]"]